# Patterns of URLs lychee should skip during link checks.
# One regex per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.

# The repo's own deep links. Checking them at push time creates noise when a
# file is renamed in the same commit.
^https://github\.com/hihipy/repo-omnibus/

# Example accounts and paths that appear in documentation, not as real links.
^https://github\.com/hihipy/sql-x-ray/blob/
